# The fleet: every deployment in one list, and the global view of that list a tab away (Zach, 2026-10-30: "basically just
# like a table, and one view of that data is the global view that lets me visualize the data on a map"). One panel,
# three views of one dataset: Map, Table, Cards. A click on a robot picks it in any of them (select: deployment); its
# runs list below, newest first, and its newest run plays, read from runs/<run>.json only when one run is picked.
# Only the One Dof Test Rack is real. Every other row is SYNTHETIC (source/build.py, seeded). docs/CONTRACT.md §33, §39.
data: deployments.json
style:
  chrome: minimal
  numbers: { digits: 4, compact: true }
  families: { property: source, colors: { real: 1, sim: 2, target: muted } }
clock: { data: samples, time: t }
datasets:
  deployments:
    data: deployments.json
    label: Deployments
  runs:
    data: runs.json
    label: Runs
  # the per-run dataset: the file the run pick names, read when exactly one run is picked (none or two: "Pick one run")
  samples:
    data: 'runs/{run}.json'
    label: Samples
links:
  - { from: deployments.deployment, to: runs.deployment, direction: one-way }
  - { from: runs.run, to: samples.run, direction: one-way }
layout:
  panels:
    - text: >-
        **Synthetic fleet, one real rack.** Only the One Dof Test Rack is real (its logged runs). Every other robot, site
        and run is made up for this example and marked synthetic. Click a robot for its runs; a counted marker lists the
        robots at that point.
      w: 12
    - { views: [Map, Table, Cards], title: Deployments, w: 12, h: 5 }
    - { view: Runs, w: 12, h: 3 }
    - { view: Playback, w: 12 }
    - { view: Angle, w: 6, h: 3 }
    - { view: Velocity, w: 6, h: 3 }
properties:
  started: { displayName: Started }
  duration_s: { displayName: Duration }
  device: { displayName: Station }
  kind: { displayName: Kind }
views:
  # level 1: the fleet, three ways. Its first row (the rack) is picked when the page opens
  - type: map
    name: Map
    from: deployments
    select: deployment
    selected: first
    coordinates: coordinates
    markerColor: status
  - type: table
    name: Table
    from: deployments
    select: deployment
    order: [name, robot_model, site, city, status, last_run, runs, basis]
  - type: cards
    name: Cards
    from: deployments
    select: deployment
    order: [name, robot_model, site, city, status, last_run, runs, basis]
  # level 2: the picked robot's runs, newest first; a click picks a run, a ctrl / cmd-click a second (then "Pick one run")
  - type: table
    name: Runs
    from: runs
    select: run
    selected: first
    order: [label, started, device, kind, duration_s, basis]
    sort:
      - { property: started, direction: DESC }
  # level 3: the picked run, on one clock spanning its t
  - type: playback
    name: Playback
    playback: { readout: true }
  - type: timeseries
    name: Angle
    from: samples
    timeseries: { x: t, 'y': q_deg, series: situation, dash: [target], legend: top, unit: '°' }
  - type: timeseries
    name: Velocity
    from: samples
    timeseries: { x: t, 'y': qd_deg_s, series: situation, dash: [target], legend: top, unit: '°/s' }
